    "body": "What happens if the element already has the attribute set, and it was not set by attribute reflection, should we remove it when it's moved?\r\n\r\nExample:\r\n```html\r\nconst element = document.createElement('div');\r\nconst label = document.createElement('div');\r\nlabel.id = 'label-id';\r\ndocument.body.appendChild(element);\r\ndocument.body.appendChild(label);\r\nelement.setAttribute('aria-labelledby', 'label-id');\r\ndocument.write(element.getAttribute('aria-labelledby') + '<br>');\r\n\r\nconst host = document.createElement('div');\r\ndocument.body.appendChild(host);\r\nhost.attachShadow({mode: 'closed'}).appendChild(label);\r\n\r\ndocument.write(element.getAttribute('aria-labelledby') + '<br>');\r\n```\r\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
