    "body": "(Checkedness is reflected by the `checked` IDL attribute. The `checked` content attribute is reflected by the `defaultChecked` IDL attribute. The content attribute should probably have been named `defaultchecked` or the `checked` IDL attribute should have been named `liveChecked` or some such, but that mistake was made a long time ago.)",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
