    "body": "Making the compromise on the conservative side is ok with me. I do agree that it can feel a bit precarious even just knowing that these cases exist. I can also see that, even if it seems highly unlikely that any given developer would stumble into one of these cases, just having to explain how the content attribute can get out of sync means the documentation necessarily has to be longer and more complicated than it would otherwise.",
